# Saving from the pause menu in Jellyfish Fields at 640x480 on Direct3D 9, into
# the empty scratch save folder. Options is X on the pause page; Save Game is
# two down. The list's first row is New save. After the save the game runs
# again, and the next pause must not show the save screen's "Save Game" title
# behind the task page.
#
# The list shows the free space on the disk, and reg_save_paused is the only
# shot after the save, whose date it would show.

wait 2400
press b
wait 120
press start
wait 60
press x
wait 60
press down
wait 30
press down
wait 30
press a
wait 90
shot reg_save_list 0
press a
wait 240
press b
wait 60
press start
wait 120
shot reg_save_paused 0
